### Test API bang extension REST Client trong VS Code (bam "Send Request" tren tung request)
@host = http://localhost:5101

### 1. Dang ky User moi
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Champ",
  "email": "champ@test.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

### 2. Dang nhap User
# @name userLogin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "champ@test.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

### 3. Xem thong tin minh (dung token tu buoc 2)
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4. User thuong goi API Admin -> phai bi 403 Forbidden
GET {{host}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 5. Dang xuat User
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{userLogin.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### 6. Dung lai refresh token da dang xuat -> phai bi 401
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{userLogin.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### 7. Dang nhap Admin
# @name adminLogin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@treeo.local",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}

### 8. Admin xem danh sach user -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 9. Dang xuat Admin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{adminLogin.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### ===== QUEN MAT KHAU =====

### 10. Xin ma dat lai mat khau -> 200
### Chua cau hinh Smtp: ma 6 so in ra o terminal dang chay Identity (dong "===== EMAIL")
POST {{host}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "champ@test.com"
}

### 11. Email khong ton tai -> van 200 voi cung mot cau (khong lo email nao da dang ky)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "khongtontai@test.com"
}

### 12. Dat lai mat khau: thay 123456 bang ma vua in o terminal -> 200 + token moi
POST {{host}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "champ@test.com",
  "code": "123456",
  "newPassword": "12345678"
}
